##### bash migration/migrate-2-firewall.sh
== dry-run: nothing is changed (add --apply to run)
== backup current ruleset
[dry-run] mkdir -p /root/migration-backup/20261121-171830
[dry-run] nft list ruleset > /root/migration-backup/20261121-171830/nft-ruleset-before.txt
== syntax check
[dry-run] nft -c -f /root/net/homelab-network/zones/nftables/zones.nft
== load zones.nft
[dry-run] nft -f /root/net/homelab-network/zones/nftables/zones.nft
== interim rules: cloudhost -> customer VMs while it moves from vmbr0 to vlan 30
[dry-run] nft insert rule inet zones from_uplink ip saddr 192.168.0.104 oifname vmbr1 accept comment "migration"
[dry-run] nft insert rule inet cloudhost_vm forward iifname vmbr0 oifname vmbr1 ip saddr 192.168.0.104 accept comment "migration"
[dry-run] nft insert rule inet cloudhost_vm forward iifname vmbr2.30 oifname vmbr1 ip saddr 10.10.30.10 accept comment "migration"
== check
[dry-run] nft list table inet zones
[dry-run] nft list table inet cloudhost_vm
expect: both tables present, tailscale and ssh still working, customer VMs still reachable from cloudhost
not persistent: a reboot drops the zones table. Make it persistent only in the last step (docs/migration-runbook.md step 6).
[exit 0]

